Will wrote:
> enchant my cloak or wait for mithril?

I didn't notice this question at first.
In case you didn't know, you can wear the cloak *on top* of armor.  So
it's not an either/or.  Besides, the cloak is better to enchant even
if you find mithril.  Mithril will be replaced as soon as you find
dragon scale, but you'll be using that cloak for the entire game.


